    "title": "FRIDAY NIGHT FOOTBALL SCORES (9-25) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kerry Barboza ,\n1 days ago The three 11-man football teams in Boerne were in action Friday night and had key district games. Champion and Geneva School of Boerne were at home, while the Greyhounds had a big road game at Alamo Heights. All three won, while Comfort High was off this week and opens district... Read full article\n1",
